What state is printed at position (4), after t1.join() has returned?,RUNNABLE,TERMINATED - join() only returns once that thread's run() has finished,NEW,WAITING,,2,"This is the reliable one. join() returning is itself the guarantee that the thread is finished, so the state after it can only be TERMINATED.",1

